data: {"id":"","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"# Software Testing QA Report\n\n## Executive Summary\nThe testing process successfully validated key system functionalities, including terminal session management, installation verifications, SQL query executions, and file configurations. Overall procedures were executed with minor issues that have been clearly highlighted for remediation.\n\n## Test Objectives\n1. Verify the proper closure of all terminal sessions and cleanup of running processes.\n2. Confirm installation and version upgrades of Spice CLI and Runtime.\n3. Validate SQL execution and file connector recipes for both Parquet and Markdown datasets.\n\n## Test Process\n1. Conducted terminal closure and cleanup operations.\n2. Installed and validated Spice.ai OSS CLI/Runtime upgrades.\n3. Executed SQL queries to compute averages and retrieve relevant file locations.\n\n## Results Summary\n- **Terminal Management:**  \n  ✅ Successfully closed all active terminal sessions, ensuring a clean state for subsequent operations.\n  \n- **Installation Validation:**  \n  ✅ Spice CLI and Runtime were upgraded to `v1.1.2` and `v1.1.2+models` respectively, with environment variables updated (`$HOME/.spice/bin` added to PATH). \n  \n- **SQL Query Execution:**  \n  ✅ A query computed the average `passenger_count` as approximately `1.3393` from the local Parquet file (`yellow_tripdata_2024-01.parquet`), confirming effective file connection.  \n  ✅ A second query successfully returned Markdown document file locations from the `docs` dataset, listing files such as `home/timmy/debezium.md`, `clickhouse.md`, `delta-lake.md`, and `databricks.md`.\n\n- **Minor Issues:**  \n  ⚠️ An “Address already in use” error was detected during HTTP server initialization, indicating a port conflict that needs to be addressed.  \n  ℹ️ A non-critical \"Text file busy\" warning was noted, but did not affect the overall testing outcomes.\n\n## Data & Evidence\n```\n# Terminal Cleanup Log:\nAll terminal sessions closed successfully using `close_all_terminals`.\n\n# CLI and Runtime Version Confirmation:\nSpice CLI version: v1.1.2\nSpice Runtime version: v1.1.2+models\n\n# SQL Query Result for Passenger Count:\nAverage passenger_count: 1.3392808966805005\n\n# Markdown Documents Query:\nReturned file locations:\n  - home/timmy/debezium.md\n  - clickhouse.md\n  - delta-lake.md\n  - databricks.md\n\n# Configuration Evidence:\nParquet file: `yellow_tripdata_2024-01.parquet`\nConfiguration file: `spicepod.yaml`\n```\n\n## Learnings and Recommendations\n1. Investigate and resolve the HTTP server \"Address already in use\" error to prevent port conflicts in future deployments.\n2. Continue using robust terminal and process management procedures to maintain a clean testing environment.\n3. Monitor all non-critical warnings closely to ensure they remain harmless.\n\n## Next Steps\n1. Address and fix the port binding issue for HTTP server initialization.\n2. Incorporate additional logging for improved issue tracing and debugging.\n3. Plan further integration tests to assess the impact of minor warnings during system operations.\n","role":"assistant","refusal":null},"finish_reason":null,"logprobs":null}],"created":1744705207,"model":"timmy","service_tier":null,"system_fingerprint":null,"object":"chat.completion.chunk"}

